      "description": "Flat evidence surface with literal quote and return control. Example text is synthetic.",
      "html": "<aside class=\"ds-evidence\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-label=\"Detalle de la memoria\"><h2 class=\"ds-panel-title\">Detrás de esta memoria</h2><button class=\"ds-return\">Volver a la afirmación</button><p class=\"ds-detail\">Una afirmación de ejemplo.</p><h3 class=\"ds-quote-title\">Cita original</h3><blockquote class=\"ds-quote\">Una afirmación de ejemplo.</blockquote></aside>",
